 "remarks": "Vintage chic, a blend of vintage and modern design. Many period details remain, crown molding, glass/brass doorknobs, kitchen pantry and HWF. A welcoming entrance includes board and batten paneling which compliments the Magnolia home wallpaper. Move-in ready, other features include new kitchen with quartz countertops, black SS sink, faucet, updated appliances, new (LED) lighting in all rooms, ample closets, freshly painted in a warm inviting palette which gives this condo a cottage style feel. HOA includes heat/hot water. A small complex with only 48 units and lots of green space. One level living, walk to Shopping Center, gym, nightlife, public transportation and Park. Easy access to I-95.  On site laundry, storage unit, 1 reserved parking space steps from condo. Why rent when you can buy.",
